<node id="paper::broad_0774386e5705dc5099bf::claim_cip_equivalence">
  <data key="d4">MechanismClaim</data>
  <data key="d5">The constant inner potential and Fermi-level GCE-DFT approaches are equivalent for metallic electrodes and inner-sphere reactions.</data>
  <data key="d6">methodological equivalence</data>
  <data key="d7">The constant inner potential and Fermi-level GCE-DFT approaches are equivalent for metallic electrodes and inner-sphere reactions.</data>
  <data key="d8">computational</data>
  <data key="d9">The equivalence is reported from numerical and analytical studies.</data>
  <data key="d10">["claim_cip_equivalence"]</data>
