  <data key="d4">MechanismClaim</data>
  <data key="d5">Single-atom platinum in Pt/np-Co0.85Se optimizes the surface states of Co0.85Se active centers under realistic working conditions, reduces the energy barriers of water dissociation, and improves hydrogen adsorption/desorption behavior, thereby promoting hydrogen-evolution thermodynamics and kinetics.</data>
