label: The strong atomic metal–support interaction in Ru/Ni3V-LDH stabilizes the dangling-bond-rich surface and reactive atomic Ru and Ni sites, enabling a steady dual-site configuration without surface reconstruction during HER/OER cycling.
source depth: abstract
